WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.000
(theme music)

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.500
- Wait. Stay standing.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.340
Wait, take your shoes off.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:06.173
- Wait, Frida. I'm
gonna take my shoes off.

00:00:06.173 --> 00:00:08.070
- Wait, okay this is me...

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.660
- It's "Bring your daughter to work" day.

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.165
- This is like, wait... (crowd cheers)

00:00:11.165 --> 00:00:12.720
I'm like,

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.760
literally, you've got
two really short people

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:15.593
and a tall people.

00:00:15.593 --> 00:00:16.426
- Speaking of Sweden. I mean...

00:00:16.426 --> 00:00:17.515
- I know. It's beautiful.

00:00:17.515 --> 00:00:18.795
You are gorgeous.

00:00:18.795 --> 00:00:19.628
- Thank you so much.

00:00:19.628 --> 00:00:20.461
Thank you for having me.

00:00:20.461 --> 00:00:21.843
I'm such a huge fan.

00:00:21.843 --> 00:00:23.130
- [Kelly] I am such a huge fan.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.420
I don't know if they told you this,

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:25.650
I literally was obsessed.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:26.580
I asked to have you on the show.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:27.720
I love Vikings: Valhalla.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.780
I think it's such a great show.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:29.613
- [Frida] Thank you so much.

00:00:29.613 --> 00:00:30.446
I am obsessed with it too.

00:00:30.446 --> 00:00:31.279
- [Kelly] Yeah. Have you seen it?

00:00:31.279 --> 00:00:32.112
Have y'all met?

00:00:32.112 --> 00:00:33.584
Have you ever interviewed?
I didn't know if you met.

00:00:33.584 --> 00:00:34.417
- Nice to meet you.

00:00:34.417 --> 00:00:35.250
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.083
- I'm such a fan. I'm with Kelly too.

00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:38.970
The stuff you do on that
show, and these legs for days,

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.987
when she gets out there, is incredible.

00:00:40.987 --> 00:00:41.820
(crowd cheers)

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:42.653
- [Kelly] And your nails.

00:00:42.653 --> 00:00:44.100
Great nail game. Everything's happening.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.787
But I have to say that
with this show, I'm like,

00:00:45.787 --> 00:00:47.790
I loved it. I saw the whole first season.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.500
I'm like, "Do you ever get hurt?"

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.180
There's like big stunts y'all are doing.

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:53.730
- Yeah. I mean, it's a
very action heavy show,

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:55.530
and even though I was very
athletic growing up...

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:56.790
- You look like a superhero. So, yeah.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:57.990
- I mean, I was so fortunate

00:00:57.990 --> 00:00:59.820
that I got to do all of my own stunts,

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.890
but with that, you know,
sometimes comes injury.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.360
I've got a couple of scars in my hands.

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.700
But there was one time,
we were about to shoot,

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:07.230
where we're doing the last rehearsal,

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:08.370
I have this big take down.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:10.587
It's a six foot seven, big man.

00:01:10.587 --> 00:01:11.420
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:12.930
- And I'm strangling him with my bracelet,

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.850
and we're doing this
big wrestle take down.

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:17.755
And of course I slip and
he lands on my elbow.

00:01:17.755 --> 00:01:20.910
I get a fracture and I
have to go to the hospital

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:22.524
wearing my full costume...

00:01:22.524 --> 00:01:23.820
(laughing)

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:25.290
And it's the middle of the pandemic,

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.974
so no one from production
could come with me.

00:01:26.974 --> 00:01:27.807
- [Kelly] That's incredible.

00:01:27.807 --> 00:01:29.220
- So I just show up at the hospital...

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:30.330
- [Kelly] Looking like a viking.

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:31.170
- Looking like a Viking.

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:34.680
Covered in blood, in my full armor.

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:37.110
And the people at hospital
are like, "What is going on?"

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.250
- Oh! And no one could come
with you, because of Covid.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.810
- No! Because of Covid.

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.377
They just dropped me
off, and they're like,

00:01:41.377 --> 00:01:42.810
"We're gonna come and pick you up."

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:45.787
So, I just walk into the
emergency room and they're like,

00:01:45.787 --> 00:01:46.980
"What happened to her?"

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.483
- Haven't seen this before.

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:50.550
- [Kelly] Oh, my gosh.

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:52.160
That's hysterical.
- That was insane.

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:52.993
- So wait, so you...

00:01:52.993 --> 00:01:53.970
Can you explain for everybody,

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:55.650
that hasn't seen Vikings: Valhalla,

00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:56.580
like, what's your character?

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:57.810
Who's your character, and
what, who do you play?

00:01:57.810 --> 00:01:59.370
So, I play Freydis Eriksdotter,

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:02.430
who is one of the most
infamously blood thirsty woman

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:03.263
of the Viking era.

00:02:03.263 --> 00:02:05.100
She is the sister of Leif Eriksson,

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.440
that I'm sure people know
a little bit more about.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.540
And yeah, so we are a continuation

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:13.410
of the original show Vikings,
and we're set 150 years after.

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:16.230
And it chronicles the most
famous Vikings that ever lived.

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:18.060
- So y'all, do you really,
do y'all study that?

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:19.870
Like, in like. in Sweden,
whenever you're a kid, you study?

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:20.730
- [Frida] Yeah. Yeah.

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:21.720
- That's really cool.

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:23.820
- I mean, being like Swedish, you know,

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:25.591
Vikings are such a huge
part of our culture.

00:02:25.591 --> 00:02:26.424
- Yeah.

00:02:26.424 --> 00:02:28.800
- [Frida] And so I was
really proud that I got to,

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:30.180
you know, represent my heritage.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:33.060
And also, funnily enough,
my dad's name is Leif,

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:34.081
like my brother in the show.

00:02:34.081 --> 00:02:34.914
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:34.914 --> 00:02:36.260
- And my nickname,
growing up, was Freydis.

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:37.093
So...

00:02:37.093 --> 00:02:37.926
- [Kelly] Oh, my gosh!

00:02:37.926 --> 00:02:38.759
- It's all like, too...

00:02:38.759 --> 00:02:39.692
Yeah, and like, meant to be.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:40.525
- [Kelly] It's a lot of happenstance.

00:02:40.525 --> 00:02:41.358
- [Kelly And Frida] Yeah.

00:02:41.358 --> 00:02:42.330
- Wow. That's crazy cool.

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:44.670
Your dad must think this
is the coolest thing ever.

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:46.350
So we've been talking
about doing things though,

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:47.850
for ourselves this year, in the new year.

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:48.683
What are you...

00:02:48.683 --> 00:02:49.650
Instead of like a New Year's resolution,

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:51.540
which is, what are you
gonna do for you this year?

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.920
- Oh my God, that's such a good question.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:54.540
I recently got married.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:55.461
- Congratulations!

00:02:55.461 --> 00:02:56.880
(crowd cheers)

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.640
I didn't actually know
that. Congratulations.

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:00.473
- [Frida] Thank you so much.

00:03:00.473 --> 00:03:01.306
- That's so beautiful.

00:03:01.306 --> 00:03:03.000
- Yeah. And I've been
in Ireland three years,

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.620
filming three seasons
of Vikings: Valhalla.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.960
So, I'm gonna spend some
more time with my family.

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:08.070
- [Kelly] Oh, that's exciting.

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:08.903
- Yeah.

00:03:08.903 --> 00:03:10.110
- [Kelly] That's hard to
do when you love working

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:11.850
and you're, you know, you love
your jobs that you're doing.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:13.380
It is hard to navigate that we're...

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.640
There is no such thing as balance, but...

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:15.510
- [Kit] No such thing as balance.

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:17.511
We'll go ahead and be your
wise older teachers over here.

00:03:17.511 --> 00:03:19.050
(laughing)

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:19.883
- I love that.

00:03:19.883 --> 00:03:20.716
- I love it though.

00:03:20.716 --> 00:03:21.549
I love that y'all shoot in Ireland too.

00:03:21.549 --> 00:03:22.382
I love Ireland.

00:03:22.382 --> 00:03:23.215
So beautiful.
- It's so beautiful.

00:03:23.215 --> 00:03:24.330
And the people, and the music.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:25.163
- [Kelly] Mm hm.

00:03:25.163 --> 00:03:25.996
- It was so unfortunate,

00:03:25.996 --> 00:03:27.240
'cause we filmed during the pandemic,

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.790
so we weren't able to
experience going, you know,

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:30.840
to the pub and listening to...

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:31.673
- Oh, my God the pubs.

00:03:31.673 --> 00:03:32.760
You've never met a stranger.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:33.750
Everyone's so nice.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:34.650
- And you're never alone.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:35.483
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:35.483 --> 00:03:36.316
- Which is a good thing, you know,

00:03:36.316 --> 00:03:37.380
you're always gonna find a friend.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.780
But finally in the, towards the
end of filming season three,

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.850
that we just wrapped
a couple of weeks ago,

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:44.370
we were able to go out and,
you know, experience Ireland,

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:45.420
which was so wonderful.

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:46.870
- [Kelly] Oh, it's beautiful.

